Z||000001||DaRkLoRD||12-31-2000||03:28 PM||||Kit Car Illustrated has those 2 cars featured this month, not sure about Kit Car Magazine. I'll check about the GT40 if you want.<P>Just a side note, near the end of the magazine, is a picture of Archie standing next to a Fino.. always cool to see someone in a magazine and be able to say "hey, I know that guy!" (sorta. heh)<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 12-31-2000).]||||reg||6
Z||000002||Cheever2||12-31-2000||04:51 PM||||Kit Car Magazine says:<BR>-AutoSport Performance Products in Arizona makes "NAF GT40 - MK1 & MK2" which goes on stock Fiero chassis... $6998 for the kit.<BR>-Also, T3 in Colorado makes their "T3 GT40 replica" which goes on rectangular tube frame... $7995 for the kit.<BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
