Z||000009||rockcrawl||12-31-2000||10:17 PM||||I've got subscriptions to both. Kit Car Magazine (the car builders authority) by Petersen, and Kit Car Illustrated by McMullen Argus. Both are US based mags. Both are bi-monthly and both have run stories on the Jalepeno within the last few issues. <P>The T3 GT40 was featured in the Feb 2001 KCI. It is based on a custom tube chassis with a Ford engine and Porsche transaxle. There are some GT40 Fiero kits that look pretty good, but they are not nearly as authentic.  <P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000010||afRaceR||01-01-2001||02:16 AM||||Can you give me some info on the VR hummer. I have been looking at hummer kits and thought I had found all of them, I don't think I've seen this one. This crappy town my parents live in, where I'm staying right now, has no places to buy any decent magazines - you have to drive 45 minutes to pick up a magazine, I hate this freakin town.<BR>Anyways, if you can give me a webpage or a phone number for it, I'd appreciate it.<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
Z||000011||rockcrawl||01-01-2001||09:31 AM||||I'm not sure where the "VR" came from? The feb 2001 KCI and jan 2001 KCM both feature the  same Classic Roadsters Hummer on the cover. It's one of the better looking ones I've seen. It sits on a GM truck frame.<P>Classic Roadsters<BR>1617 Main Ave,<BR>Fargo, ND 58103<BR>800-373-9000 <A HREF="http://www.classicroadsters.com" TARGET=_blank>www.classicroadsters.com</A> <P>------------------<BR>Jon Lagler<BR>'87 GT<BR>4.9 liter V8 Testarossa Spyder (under construction)<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/rockcrawlsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000012||afRaceR||01-01-2001||01:13 PM||||Ok, I thought I didn't know about one that was out there. The Badlands, as classic calls it, is definately one of the better built kits out there. I'll probably end up going with this one whenever I get around to making my replica.<BR>Thanks||||reg||1
